Package: gsim
Type: Package
Title: Genomic Simulation for Validation Studies
Version: 0.2.0
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Sørensen", email = "peter.sorensen@r-qgg.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates genotype, pedigree, and phenotype data for validation
    studies. Supports independent simulated genotypes, caller-provided genotype
    matrices, optional qgg genotype-list objects, scalable multigenerational
    pedigrees, sparse scalar observation records, incomplete multitrait patterns,
    and longitudinal random-regression workloads.
License: GPL-3
Suggests:
    qgg,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C++11
